sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest
    participant Channel as Channel Adapter
    participant Gateway as Gateway and Tenant Context
    participant AI as AI Orchestrator
    participant Services as Availability and Pricing Services
    participant Workflow as Reservation Workflow
    participant External as Payment, Calendar, and Notification
    participant Evidence as Telemetry and Evidence

    Guest->>Channel: Ask availability and price
    Channel->>Gateway: Normalized request
    Gateway->>AI: Authorized tenant and property context
    AI->>Services: Query authoritative availability and rate
    Services-->>AI: Versioned itemized result
    AI-->>Guest: Grounded answer and required next input
    Guest->>Channel: Request reservation
    Channel->>Gateway: Idempotent reservation command
    Gateway->>Workflow: Start tenant-bound booking workflow
    Workflow->>Services: Hold availability and confirm pricing
    Workflow->>External: Coordinate deposit, guest details, and messages
    External-->>Workflow: Correlated outcomes
    Workflow-->>Guest: Confirmation or actionable exception
    Workflow->>Evidence: Record state, events, health, and evidence
